      <h2><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=172" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Functional Features and The Case for Hybrid Lexus">
        Functional Features and The Case for Hybrid Lexus        </a></h2>
      <small>
      July 28th, 2012            </small>
      <p><strong>The case for hybrid </strong>Lexus are exclusively designed with high quality technology for maximum performance. In the exclusive http://www.lexus.co.uk/ you will be able to understand the exclusive features of these awesome sedans. In the hybrid version the cars will be loaded with two varieties of power sources such as the combustion engine and electric motor. As we all know both these versions of power producers are carefully designed for enjoying ultimate fuel efficiency in the roads. Since the case for hybrid Lexus cars are driven at less speed with electric motor it emits zero percentage of CO2 that help in driving cool hybrid version sedan the  without making much noise pollution.</p>
<p>When people think of<a href="http://www.lexus.co.uk/hybrid/index.tmex"> <strong>the case for hybrid</strong></a> in Lexus they assume to plug in the vehicle to a source of power all night to get charged fully for the next day performance, but the hybrid cars provides the option to select the power version in which you want to drive and also automatically balances the engine power for saving economy to the ultimate. The batteries are recharged in an automatic way and therefore it is not necessary to plug in to a power source every time the battery is low. The sophisticated hybrid technologies are offered by all the hybrid introductions of the Lexus. You can know more details about the fuel efficiency in the Lexus through the <a href="http://www.lexus.co.uk/">http://www.lexus.co.uk/</a> This innovative sedan is not a sluggish introduction that is slow or dull in prrformance but they are power packed full performance vehicles with exclusive functional features.</p>
<p><strong>The case for hybrid</strong> Lexus cars provide basically two types of sedans namely mild and micro hybrids. The mild hybrid variety cars possess separate battery for charging the electric motor in the car. This offer extra power that can be supplemented during the time of acceleration. The micro hybrids do not have the battery for elegantly propelling the car but the functions are controlled by clicking on the start and stop buttons. This reduces the emission of CO2 to a great extent thus efficiently saving fuel.</p>
<div>
<p>When you own a hybrid Lexus from the http://www.lexus.co.uk/ then you will be provided tax credit by the Government.  <strong>The case of hybrid</strong> sedans can be tasted with maximum speed of 50 miles with one gallon. The hybrid varieties of cars run without noise thus helping to create a world without the annoying noise pollution. Fuel efficiency is the ultimate benefit one enjoys when he or she owns a hybrid Lexus.</p>
</div>
      <p>Tags: <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?tag=hybrid-lexus" rel="tag">hybrid lexus</a></p>      <p class="postmetadata">Posted in
        <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?cat=31" title="View all posts in Lexus" rel="category">Lexus</a>        |
                <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=172#respond" title="Comment on Functional Features and The Case for Hybrid Lexus">No Comments &#187;</a>      </p>
    </div>
        <div class="post" id="post-166">
      <h2><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=166" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Replacement Car Batteries for Your Pride and Joy">
        Replacement Car Batteries for Your Pride and Joy        </a></h2>
      <small>
      April 29th, 2012            </small>
      <p><a href="http://www.battery2u.co.uk/">Purchasing a car battery replacement</a> for their pride and joy is a task that the majority of drivers are unable to put off. Not all car batteries are equal, however, and this must be taken into consideration by anyone looking to buy new car batteries.</p>
<p>Only a small number of battery manufacturers are in existence and they sell their batteries under a variety of brand names. Drivers who do not have the time to research each of the different brands may simply wish to opt for the same make of battery that they possessed previously.</p>
<p>Large car parts shops will offer an extensive inventory of batteries at <a href="http://www.battery2u.co.uk/car-batteries/">relatively low car battery prices</a>. They may also be able to provide installation. A car owner can install a battery themselves, but it can be tricky and they must have the facilities to dispose of their old battery in the correct manner.</p>
<p>The two most important factors when selecting a battery are the battery&#8217;s group size and cold-cranking amps. The group size refers to a battery&#8217;s outside dimensions and the positioning of its terminals. Car owners should select a battery of a group size recommended by their car&#8217;s manufacturer as the wrong size may not fit adequately. Cold-cranking amps, or CCAs, are a measure of a car battery&#8217;s ability to function in cold weather.</p>
<p>When purchasing a replacement battery, car owners should buy a battery that has been manufactured within the last six months. A date code is usually printed on a battery&#8217;s case. The majority of date codes begin with a letter, indicating the month, and with a digit, indicating the year. A date code that starts with B4 would therefore stand for February 2004 while a date code that starts with A1 would stand for January 2001. </p>
      <p>Tags: <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?tag=car-batteries-replacement" rel="tag">Car Batteries Replacement</a>, <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?tag=replace-car-batteries" rel="tag">replace car batteries</a>, <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?tag=replacement-car" rel="tag">Replacement Car</a>, <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?tag=replacement-car-batteries" rel="tag">Replacement Car Batteries</a></p>      <p class="postmetadata">Posted in
        <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?cat=61" title="View all posts in Car Tips" rel="category">Car Tips</a>        |
                <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=166#respond" title="Comment on Replacement Car Batteries for Your Pride and Joy">No Comments &#187;</a>      </p>
    </div>
        <div class="post" id="post-163">
      <h2><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=163" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Why Auto Insurance is a Must for You">
        Why Auto Insurance is a Must for You        </a></h2>
      <small>
      March 31st, 2012            </small>
      <p>Whether you like it or not, accidents and other exigencies may often occur with an automobile. On the receiving ends would be the owner, driver, and the passengers, if any in the automobile in case of accidents. This will lead to direct and indirect expenses for the owner. <a href="http://www.freeinsurancequotes.org/"><strong>Auto insurance</strong></a><strong> </strong>could be the ideal solution for such exigencies.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>First; there would be the expenses relating to injuries to the person or damages to the properties sustained by third parties in such accident including hospital bills. Second; there could be expenses related to repairs and restoration of the damaged automobile. Third; and perhaps most important of all; would be legal expenses involved in such cases.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Usually such expenses are high and few people stay well prepared to meet such expensive exigencies. In such cases quality <strong>auto insurance</strong><strong> </strong>coverage would come up very handy providing finance at real times and resolving all the problems of the car owner or driver.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Your task is therefore cut out at finding the best provider of such insurance plans. A quality website can help you get free <strong>auto insurance</strong><strong> </strong>quotes and choose the best by way of comparison.</p>
      <p>Tags: <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?tag=auto-insurance" rel="tag">Auto Insurance</a>, <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?tag=insurance" rel="tag">Insurance</a>, <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?tag=insurance-is-a-must" rel="tag">Insurance is a Must</a>, <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?tag=safety" rel="tag">safety</a></p>      <p class="postmetadata">Posted in
        <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?cat=56" title="View all posts in Auto Tips" rel="category">Auto Tips</a>        |
                <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=163#respond" title="Comment on Why Auto Insurance is a Must for You">No Comments &#187;</a>      </p>
    </div>
        <div class="post" id="post-160">
      <h2><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=160" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to UK Charging Companies to Drive on British Roads">
        UK Charging Companies to Drive on British Roads        </a></h2>
      <small>
      February 1st, 2012            </small>
      <p>The UK is trying to strike a balance for UK haulers. UK haulers have long had to pay foreign hauling fees and tolls. Yet, those coming from Europe to the UK have not been subject to the same experience. Now the UK has implemented a 10 pound per day fee. It is a pay as you drive road charge for lorries coming from out of country to deliver goods. Authorities are going to check the vehicles to see that they have the proper permit on their windscreens.</p>
<p>The move is to help more UK haulage companies. It is also meant to off-set the charges by offering a tax rebate to the UK based companies. The charge is meant to be a fair deal for UK companies who are employing UK drivers. It is also a growth tactic to be used. To give one an idea, any UK driver going to the Netherlands on a two day return will pay 15 pounds. It means any UK company going to the Netherlands will have to shell out money to travel on the roads in Europe. It is seen as only fair these drivers coming from Europe are charged to travel in the UK.</p>
<p>The downside is that the UK cannot discriminate against any drivers under the EU. It means that the UK will also see this charge, but the rebate is where the firms gain their money back. It means they will not have to increase their costs over the long term since they will see the money come back.</p>
<p>If you are worried about the new charges due to the fair play rules, then you might look at other ways you can save throughout the year until that tax rebate shows up for the UK driving tax. For instance <a href="http://www.trackcompare.co.uk/fuel-cards">business fuel cards</a> are handy products that help you reduce fees you pay. These cards allow a discount at the pump on the fuel your drivers purchase. The discount will add up over the year where you may save more than 10p per litre each time your driver fills up.</p>
<p>Since the savings adds up you may be ahead by thousands of pounds by the end of the year. It is certainly one way for you to get a little help in an otherwise tough economy. Plus, with fuel fluctuating in price you can be prepared to still save.</p>
      <p>Tags: <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?tag=business-fuel-cards" rel="tag">business fuel cards</a>, <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?tag=uk-charging-companies" rel="tag">UK Charging Companies</a></p>      <p class="postmetadata">Posted in
        <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?cat=53" title="View all posts in Cars Tips" rel="category">Cars Tips</a>        |
                <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=160#respond" title="Comment on UK Charging Companies to Drive on British Roads">No Comments &#187;</a>      </p>
    </div>
        <div class="post" id="post-156">
      <h2><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=156" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to 2012 Lexus RX 350: redefining luxury through advances in technology">
        2012 Lexus RX 350: redefining luxury through advances in technology        </a></h2>
      <small>
      November 18th, 2011      Arnold      </small>
      <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/11/2012-Lexus-RX-350.jpg"><img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-157" title="2012 Lexus RX 350" src="http://turbo-infiniti.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/11/2012-Lexus-RX-350.jpg" alt="" width="275" height="183" /></a></p>
<p>Luxury segment has been consolidated by the introduction of <strong>Lexus RX 350</strong> that has captivated large section of auto enthusiasts. It is an astounding piece of designers delight incorporating 178 inch wheel providing jaw dropping performance. Bolstered by the presence of power front seats, the interiors are of extremely high quality synonymous with the brand of Lexus.  As a part of the cutting edge technology system installed on the vehicle, sun roof is combined along with exterior mirrors that possess the unique quality of auto dimming.</p>
<p><strong>Lexus RX 350: Breaking the traditional boundaries of style</strong></p>
<p>Safety is of paramount importance in Lexus loaded with front air bags helping the drivers when faced with accidents and other eventualities. Similarly side curtain bags provide complete security to the children and other passengers in an impeccable manner. Advanced innovation in technology has enabled the vehicle to undergo radical transformation in terms of style.  Leather seats are impeccable and are accompanied by the wood trim, making the sedan a cynosure of eyes of auto enthusiasts. Ample spaces for the luggage, meet the expectations of prospective buyers.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
            <p class="postmetadata">Posted in
        <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?cat=31" title="View all posts in Lexus" rel="category">Lexus</a>        |
                <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=156#respond" title="Comment on 2012 Lexus RX 350: redefining luxury through advances in technology">No Comments &#187;</a>      </p>
    </div>
        <div class="post" id="post-153">
      <h2><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=153" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to 2012 Chevrolet Tahoe: Futuristic SUV based on tradition">
        2012 Chevrolet Tahoe: Futuristic SUV based on tradition        </a></h2>
      <small>
      November 18th, 2011      Arnold      </small>
      <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/11/2012-Chevrolet-Tahoe.jpg"><img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-154" title="2012 Chevrolet Tahoe" src="http://turbo-infiniti.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/11/2012-Chevrolet-Tahoe.jpg" alt="" width="287" height="176" /></a></p>
<p>Die hard enthusiasts of SUV are large in numbers and Tahoe is an ideal fodder that suits their style in an impeccable fashion. It is a well known fact that rear suspension is designed in a compliant format; however the overall demeanor is of masculine toughness inherent in most of the SUVs. With V8 engine powering its body the overall structure of SUV commands respect and is quite intimidating.</p>
<p><strong>Unparalleled styling with greater control:</strong></p>
<p>People get flummoxed by the interior and the engine design which is the symbol of raw power that the vehicle exudes. It is equipped with automatic transmission which spans across six speed modes transforming it in to a comfortable drive for the auto lovers.  On the highway it transforms in to a modern racer touching 60MPH in to 8.4 seconds. Chrysler has incorporated slew of measures in to the vehicle as trademark safety features, including stupendous disc brakes enabling the drivers to instill a sense of stability in to the machine.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
            <p class="postmetadata">Posted in
        <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?cat=13" title="View all posts in Chevrolet" rel="category">Chevrolet</a>        |
                <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=153#respond" title="Comment on 2012 Chevrolet Tahoe: Futuristic SUV based on tradition">No Comments &#187;</a>      </p>
    </div>
        <div class="post" id="post-150">
      <h2><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=150" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to 2012 Chrysler 200: Source of Power and comfort">
        2012 Chrysler 200: Source of Power and comfort        </a></h2>
      <small>
      November 18th, 2011      Arnold      </small>
      <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/11/2012-Chrysler-200.jpg"><img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-151" title="2012 Chrysler 200" src="http://turbo-infiniti.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/11/2012-Chrysler-200.jpg" alt="" width="287" height="175" /></a></p>
<p>Variety of sedans has been launched that have captured the imagination of people in a great manner. <strong>Chrysler 200 </strong>has been latest in the tradition that tastes the pinnacle of success. It is a very popular vehicle, which is quite famous among the auto lovers, because it upholds the tradition of excellence of Chrysler Corporation. Stout engine is loaded with 4 cylinders that offer a flamboyant performance to the users. It is a well known fact that with 2.4 L, the total power generated is about 173 HP and the torque is about 166 pound feet, which is awesome and amazing.</p>
<p><strong>Chrysler 200: Lavishly styled interiors</strong></p>
<p>Internal ambience has undergone a structural change which is manifested in the form of revamped interiors that are in a class of their own. Dash board is in confirmation with technological innovation of the present, creating huge level of curiosity among the hardcore auto experts.  Customized rooftop is introduced depending on the requirements and specifications of the user.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
