        <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?cat=14" title="View all posts in Chrysler" rel="category">Chrysler</a>        |
                <a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=150#respond" title="Comment on 2012 Chrysler 200: Source of Power and comfort">No Comments &#187;</a>      </p>
    </div>
        <div class="post" id="post-147">
      <h2><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=147" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to 2012 Chevrolet Avalanche: New kid on the Block">
        2012 Chevrolet Avalanche: New kid on the Block        </a></h2>
      <small>
      November 18th, 2011      Arnold      </small>
      <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/11/2012-Chevrolet-Avalanche.jpg"><img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-148" title="2012 Chevrolet Avalanche" src="http://turbo-infiniti.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/11/2012-Chevrolet-Avalanche.jpg" alt="" width="276" height="182" /></a></p>
<p>It is a classic hybrid born as a result of the cross over between an SUV and the Pickup. According to experts Avalanche is a smart piece of innovation from the Chevrolet engineers. It is a well known fact that the aforesaid vehicle is designed in a modular style with two rows offering it an appearance of SUV. Rear seats can be seamlessly folded to form the pickup which will transform it into a multi utility vehicle.</p>
<p><strong>Chevrolet Avalanche: Suave interior styling</strong></p>
<p>There are numerous options available with avalanche and four wheel drives is one of them. 5.3 L engine is egged on by 8 cylinders offering huge power. Coupled with the 8 speed transmission, vehicle offers the driver a wonderful product which has fewer parallels in automobile sector. Fuel consumption is impressive and stands at 18 miles per gallon in the city. Exquisite interiors combined with safety feature offer complete security to the passengers.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
