      <h2><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=144" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to 2012 Toyota FJ Cruiser: Amazing machine delivering killer punch">
        2012 Toyota FJ Cruiser: Amazing machine delivering killer punch        </a></h2>
      <small>
      November 18th, 2011      Arnold      </small>
      <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/11/2012-Toyota-FJ-Cruiser.jpg"><img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-145" title="2012 Toyota FJ Cruiser" src="http://turbo-infiniti.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/11/2012-Toyota-FJ-Cruiser.jpg" alt="" width="259" height="194" /></a></p>
<p>First view of the <strong>FJ Cruiser </strong>might not delight the diehard auto movers but its specifications offer great variation to the customers. It is a well known fact that SUV is designed for terrains that are rugged and demand power from the machines. Departure angles are accompanied by a wide chassis providing full support to the users. They are quintessential components helping the machine to strike a balance so that users are able to relish the comfort.</p>
<p><strong>FJ Cruiser: qualitative analysis<br />
</strong> Wheels are integral to a vehicle and are especially designed for the cruiser. Trim is combined with a steel wheel enabling the user to feel the luxury along with sturdiness of the vehicle.  Apart from above classy and elegant steering wheel with leather straps is an astonishing combination appealing to large number of hardcore enthusiasts. Mesmerizing capacity of 4.0 L along with six cylinders provides tremendous power captivating the driver to a great extent.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
