        <div class="post" id="post-141">
      <h2><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/?p=141" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to 2011 Audi Q7 TDI: Breakthrough in technological innovation">
        2011 Audi Q7 TDI: Breakthrough in technological innovation        </a></h2>
      <small>
      November 18th, 2011      Arnold      </small>
      <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://turbo-infiniti.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/11/2011-Audi-Q7-TDI.jpg"><img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-142" title="2011 Audi Q7 TDI" src="http://turbo-infiniti.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/11/2011-Audi-Q7-TDI.jpg" alt="" width="275" height="184" /></a></p>
<p>Launch of the Audi Q7 TDI has created huge ruckus in the automobile market. Analyzing the body parts would introduce various aspects of the Q7 regarded as the knight in shining armor for the company. Internal structure including engine is based on 8 cylinders delivering formidable power to the vehicle.  It is a huge SUV, which would dwarf other machines, while riding on the road. Front row offers lots of space to the users helping them to be comfortable.  It is available in three engines working in combination with petrol and diesel respectively.</p>
<p><strong>Enticing Style coupled with other options:</strong></p>
<p>There are dazzling array of LED lights combined with superb interiors capturing imagination of people. Plush seats and amazing rear view mirrors are important security features helping the users to enjoy the drive.  Navigational system is deployed to ensure that drivers are able to comfortably move on the super cruise highway. Second row is loaded with amazing airbags that are durable and would go a long way in providing security to the people.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
